  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Thasunda Brown Duckett (born July 22, 1973) is an American businesswoman who is the president and chief executive officer (CEO) of TIAA. She is a former CEO of Chase Consumer Banking, a division of JPMorgan Chase, and a member of the board of directors of Nike. Duckett is also a member of The Business Council's executive committee.\n\n",
